{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "12d32d08a77f4dc75edcff3347fc722dc4a1d0eed60cbe20e68eeea98f845684", "ja": "これからも…", "zh": "今后也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "82398babd4c844b3255dd7a2986ff23104db60fc71c6d57fc6d7b3b83a4edee8", "ja": "取材で『FleurS』の歩みを聞いていたのは\n百合子ファンで、かつ3人の出演が決まった\nドラマの原作者でもある風ノ先生だった。\n取材を終えた3人は、これからの活動へ向け\nて決意を新たにする。", "zh": "在采访中听取『FleurS』发展历程的风ノ老师，既是百合子粉丝，也是确定由3人出演的电视剧的原作者。\n结束采访的3人，重新下定决心，准备迎接今后的活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1000_syuzaisya2", "source_sha256": "bdb3d5a3dbc5746e43735d8c5a2f411b7b6bb939fcab59a1fa4b4d85dde47c50", "ja": "うう……まさかみなさんにそんなことがあったなんて。\nぐすっ……。", "zh": "呜呜……没想到大家竟然经历过那样的事情。\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "06d5fc3eb7e2ded3777d7e2f0176b78d16180edbb878251c7a50e8291831fd32", "ja": "ふふっ、今となってはいい思い出ね。おかげで\n桃子ちゃんも、素直に甘えてくれるようになったし♪", "zh": "呵呵，现在回想起来，已经成了美好的回忆呢。多亏了那件事，桃子也变得愿意坦率地向我撒娇了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "c03e3af800fc3da85fa3fcaeecc035193f746244efea9152f7b153027b99ea36", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっとこのみさん！", "zh": "等、等一下！このみ小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "95b5f91152f6473eb47c8cde1195e7215f26f99643bf90500d6b61c674f2bb30", "ja": "ふふふっ♪", "zh": "呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1004_407bnp", "source_sha256": "b772c11a0f9974c13ab7e5867bc9d7b29e1f60b40431927c35c1936fd2827b36", "ja": "それで、どうでしたか？　今回は3人をモチーフにした\n新作小説のための取材とのことでしたが……。", "zh": "那么，结果怎么样？听说这次是为了采访以3人为原型的新小说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1005_syuzaisya2", "source_sha256": "0f70143055befb66470e05dc2fe9efeb1c3f2ea81fa0da227703ab5e765de326", "ja": "すごく参考になりました……！　アイディアも沢山。\n帰ったら早速、まとめてみようと思います。", "zh": "非常有参考价值……！也获得了很多灵感。\n回去后我想马上整理一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "abb77687964466fadd3a47eb3aa7950dfdf627d047447410bd5ffe0b268284b7", "ja": "わぁ、どんなお話になるんだろう……♪\n前回が探偵だったから、今度は青春とか！？", "zh": "哇，会写成什么样的故事呢……♪\n上次写的是侦探，下次会是青春题材之类的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "fabccedf7b443ff97e6a91e5e9a5b4b85df49db21aa2fd5eb7c6c1fdbec36c8a", "ja": "でも、風ノ先生の作風ならロマンスも……。\nああ、早く読みたいなぁ……♪", "zh": "不过，以风ノ老师的创作风格来说，浪漫题材也不是没可能……  \n啊，好想快点读到啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "07adf878d2e1216a0805e39ea70b39fb439eac895968fa86f7b4c5929a7260f3", "ja": "百合子さん、いくらなんでも気が早すぎ。\n先生にプレッシャーかかっちゃうでしょ？", "zh": "百合子，未免也太心急了吧。\n这样会给老师压力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8d014c6e9c3babbb1ebf6eeae94bfd1ce668037a9b764200fd74a245b996fad", "ja": "ああっ！？　ご、ごめんなさい！", "zh": "啊！？对、对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "93421e4579a890b2101b263e73727787b11de85d6927e67cda99bb8a172db845", "ja": "でも……。また人気が出てドラマ化したら、\n桃子たちも出たいから……。がんばってね、先生！", "zh": "不过……要是之后又受欢迎、被改编成电视剧的话，桃子也想出演……所以，先生要加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1011_syuzaisyakazano", "source_sha256": "07a8d80ea4ed33ed33ad0ff21414f6e396cd561fa793cbda26368b1c36d942a8", "ja": "はいっ！　今日はお忙しいなか、\n本当に貴重なお話をありがとうございました。", "zh": "好的！今天您百忙之中，\n真的非常感谢您分享如此宝贵的内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "14588244775c9b86335ceb28c7c2ff37e251a0d24c6165638e2d3d9934f335dc", "ja": "さてと、私たちも頑張らないとね。\nさっき桃子ちゃんが言ってたことじゃないけど……", "zh": "好了，我们也得加油才行呢。虽然不是刚才桃子说的那番话，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "a42f7528933f4ddcb1341e2812fecc9ecc8390a25f9da86ca42b777eafe005a4", "ja": "もしまたドラマのオファーをもらえたとしても、\n実力がついてなきゃ、胸を張って受けられないもの。", "zh": "就算再接到电视剧的通告，\n要是自身没有相应的实力，也没法挺起胸膛接下来嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "9a3ecd001637a3c4f8925ed18163a37ac5b0a035e0ef7fcae44005e67388b0d8", "ja": "そうですね。トップアイドルと演技の、\nふたつの道で活躍するユニット……。", "zh": "是啊。能够在顶级偶像和演技这两条道路上大放异彩的组合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "b889fda26f0f92f39f28c6620ae3156efc1ee129c560fcfde7363e3debbd3399", "ja": "道のりはまだまだ長いですけど、\n私達三人なら……きっと実現できますよね！", "zh": "虽然路还很漫长，\n但只要是我们三个人……一定能实现吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "31842014a9935df857ef73d406ae84cae7bd76346fb4252aeadaf21055f8d001", "ja": "うん。演技のほうは、桃子がビシバシ鍛えるからね！\n……だから、その……。", "zh": "嗯。演技方面，桃子会狠狠锻炼你们的！\n……所以，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "461a88083ae5a927c05f2bb76d030cf109ff40e42dd1b4a5d97a23243fdb65cc", "ja": "これからも、ずっと一緒にいてね！", "zh": "以后也要一直陪着我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "1aed650584f501c0f8e8934aa5f4012d9e9640f1ae6de271688337d0b1bc7ed6", "ja": "……。うんっ！", "zh": "……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "c3aef4552d01fe5c69f61f65c3bd2562557452e5efff1e110e562f5df138dc1c", "ja": "……。ええっ！", "zh": "……。好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "7b1f4f981811df91ba5459c32313a8df4803662fc80358cb047d14d8e4e02acd", "ja": "……そう、アイドルの夢は終わらない", "zh": "……没错，偶像的梦想永远不会结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "46948ad1f30939d62bde4b8fa9136f8ccc5719f7a6a3f5820cc1d3c3e3aa5bda", "ja": "私たちはこの場所で……夢が咲き笑顔が芽吹くこの劇場\nで、それぞれ違う、特別な劇場の日々を紡いでいく", "zh": "我们就在这里……在这座梦想盛开、笑颜萌发的剧场里，各自编织着属于自己的、独一无二的剧场时光", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "a26f10a4773f3b63a29e4e00767d28370f42d5a85241521ddbcc49ffbb58bd29", "ja": "悩みや不安を抱えてしまうこともあるけれど、\n未来に向けて……一歩ずつ歩みを重ねていく", "zh": "虽然有时也会烦恼、感到不安，\n但我们会朝着未来……一步一步地继续前行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "3c13667a4953cd56a39cebd7e2327cd3bb52fcdba5f995297f91701eece0f91a", "ja": "いつの日かきっと……\n誰より輝ける日が来るのを信じて！", "zh": "总有一天……\n坚信能比任何人都更加闪耀的那一天定会到来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0347_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0347_story_07_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "c9c907545fd0b7c8ce67e474b90ac383af600204da46be30f099626d0592a6c5", "ja": "でも、それはまた\n別のお話……。", "zh": "不过，那又是另一个故事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
